# The release machinery. A PR run uses its own copy of the workflow files, so
# review here is what stops a change from weakening release-check or the
# release pipeline. Listed separately so these paths can be narrowed to fewer
# owners later. Do not add version.json or the generated manifests here: the
# release bot edits them in nearly every PR, which would force a code owner
# review on all of them.
/.github/workflows/                @mycorx/mycorx-dev-team
/.github/release-components.json   @mycorx/mycorx-dev-team
/.github/renovate.json5            @mycorx/mycorx-dev-team
/.github/CODEOWNERS                @mycorx/mycorx-dev-team
/scripts/release/                  @mycorx/mycorx-dev-team
/scripts/smoke/                    @mycorx/mycorx-dev-team
